          "title": "You'll want to know: ગમગીન",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગમગીન — gamgīn — \"gloomy; sorrowful\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "મિત્ર ગયા પછી અરુણ આખો દિવસ ગમગીન રહ્યો. mitra gayā pachī Aruṇ ākho divas gamgīn rahyo. After his friend left, Arun stayed gloomy all day."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ગમગીન (gamgīn) is usually traced to Persian ġamgīn, \"sorrowful\", built on ġam, \"grief\"."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
